Replaced the out-of-line `SetFieldSINT16Value` wrapper call with a direct `SetField(Field(...))` call, avoiding one function call while preserving identical field construction and insertion logic.

```cpp
    void SetEndTimezoneOffset(FIT_SINT16 endTimezoneOffset)
    {
        SetField(Field(3, endTimezoneOffset, 0, FIT_SUBFIELD_INDEX_MAIN_FIELD));
    }
```